          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}y&=2(x+1)^{-4}\\\\\\frac{dy}{dx}&=2(-4)(x+1)^{-5}(1)\\\\\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\frac{8}{(x+1)^5}\\end{aligned}$",
